    "directions": [
      "Heat ghee in sauce pan and add in chicken pieces. Sprinkle salt as per taste.",
      "Saute chicken pieces for 2 minutes and take out on a plate.",
      "In the same pan add in sliced ginger, fresh chilli and saute for a minute.",
      "Add in turmeric, yellow chilli powder and stir for 30 seconds. Pour in chicken stock, and soaked almonds. Cook on a medium flame for 3-4 minutes.",
      "Add in cooked tovar dal, garam masala, crushed black pepper and adjust salt. Cook for another 2 minutes."
